    <!-- 7 SANCTITY OF LIFE & ABORTION -->
    <section class="screen" data-teach="abortion">
      <span class="tag lo">Abortion</span>
      <h2>Sanctity of life vs quality of life</h2>
      <p>Two key ideas frame this debate. The <span class="hl y">sanctity of life</span> is the belief that life is holy and God-given, so it must be protected. <b>Quality of life</b> arguments weigh a person's wellbeing and circumstances. In the UK, abortion is generally permitted up to <b>24 weeks</b> under conditions set by the Abortion Act, and later if the mother's life is at serious risk.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><b>Roman Catholic Church:</b> opposes abortion, teaching that life begins at <b>conception</b> and must be protected.</li>
        <li><b>Some Christians and Muslims:</b> accept abortion in certain circumstances, e.g. serious risk to the mother's life. Many Muslim scholars regard it as more serious after ensoulment (often taken as <b>120 days</b>), permitting it before then only for serious reasons.</li>
        <li><b>Humanists:</b> generally support a woman's right to choose, weighing wellbeing and circumstances rather than a fixed rule.</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="note"><b>Sensitively:</b> this is a real and difficult issue. The aim is to represent the <b>range</b> of views accurately — sanctity-of-life and quality-of-life arguments both feature in the exam.</div>
    </section>

    <!-- 8 Q: abortion MCQ -->
    <section class="screen" data-test="q-abortion">
      <span class="tag">Quick check</span>
      <h2>Views on abortion</h2>
      <div class="activity">
        <div class="qline"><span class="qnum">?</span><span>Which statement correctly describes the <b>Roman Catholic Church's</b> teaching on abortion?</span></div>
        <div class="opts" data-q="q2" data-why="The Roman Catholic Church opposes abortion, teaching that life begins at conception and must be protected (the sanctity of life). Other Christians, some Muslims and Humanists hold a range of other views.">
          <button class="opt" data-correct="0">It actively encourages abortion in all cases <span class="mk">❌</span></button>
          <button class="opt" data-correct="1">It opposes abortion, teaching life begins at conception <span class="mk">✅</span></button>
          <button class="opt" data-correct="0">It has no teaching on the subject at all <span class="mk">❌</span></button>
          <button class="opt" data-correct="0">It permits abortion up to birth for any reason <span class="mk">❌</span></button>
        </div>
